                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "@HouseGOP passed @POTUS's One Big Beautiful Bill  this morning. I voted for the legislation to protect Medicaid, provide tax cuts for middle & working class families, invest in job creation, make air traffic control safer, secure our borders and restore American energy independence. Despite lies from the extreme left, this package is focused on getting our government programs under control, so we can preserve benefits for those who need them the most. \n\nMEDICAID FACTS: \n\u2705Removes 1.4 million illegal immigrants from the program\n\u2705Removes 1.2 million ineligible recipients + waste, fraud, abuse\n\u2705Puts 4.8 million able-bodied adults ages 19-34 without children back to work - 80 hours per MONTH\n\nMORE FACTS ABOUT THE BILL: \n\u2705Provides historic tax cut for middle & working class\n\u2705Protects Child Tax Credit from being cut in half\n\u2705Eliminates tax on tips\n\u2705Eliminates tax on overtime\n\u2705Slashes social security taxes\n\u2705Secures our borders\n\u2705Invests in energy independence\n\nRead more at: https://t.co/eyO9gklgsY",
